  "description": "The answer to a say, one per verdict. `turn`: the words are a turn, `turn_id` names it and `record_id` is the id its message will have. Every other verdict records nothing and has `turn_id` null: the phone resumes her audio on `backchannel`, `unclear` and `echo`; the brain has stopped her on `stop` and `wait`, and ended the conversation on `dismissed` and `quiet:<level>` (levels quiet, no-pop, dnd, off); on `elsewhere` and `not_owner` another device or another voice has it and the phone does not resend. A client handles a verdict it does not know like `backchannel`.",
